{"expires":1779739877871,"value":{"code":200,"headers":{"etag":"W/\"fgmIcISSqc\"","last-modified":"Mon, 25 May 2026 19:11:17 GMT","cache-control":"max-age=3600"},"body":{"title":"Authentication","slug":"authentication","tags":["auth","security","jwt"],"content":"# Authentication\n\nDevDocs uses JWT-based authentication. Tokens are short-lived (1 hour) and\nrefreshed automatically via a rotating refresh token stored in an HttpOnly cookie.\n\n## Login\n\n```http\nPOST /auth/login\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{ \"email\": \"user@example.com\", \"password\": \"secret\" }\n```\n\n**Response:**\n\n```json\n{ \"access_token\": \"eyJ...\", \"expires_in\": 3600 }\n```\n\n## Token Refresh\n\n```http\nPOST /auth/refresh\n```\n\nThe refresh token is read from the cookie automatically. A new access token is returned.\n\n## Logout\n\n```http\nPOST /auth/logout\n```\n\nClears the refresh token cookie server-side.\n","body":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tag":"h1","props":{"id":"authentication"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Authentication"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"DevDocs uses JWT-based authentication. Tokens are short-lived (1 hour) and\nrefreshed automatically via a rotating refresh token stored in an HttpOnly cookie."}]},{"type":"element","tag":"h2","props":{"id":"login"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Login"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"pre","props":{"className":"language-http","code":"POST /auth/login\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{ \"email\": \"user@example.com\", \"password\": \"secret\" }\n","language":"http","meta":"","style":"undefined"},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"code","props":{"__ignoreMap":""},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"POST /auth/login\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{ \"email\": \"user@example.com\", \"password\": \"secret\" }\n"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"strong","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Response:"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"pre","props":{"className":"language-json","code":"{ \"access_token\": \"eyJ...\", \"expires_in\": 3600 }\n","language":"json","meta":"","style":"undefined"},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"code","props":{"__ignoreMap":""},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"{ \"access_token\": \"eyJ...\", \"expires_in\": 3600 }\n"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"h2","props":{"id":"token-refresh"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Token Refresh"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"pre","props":{"className":"language-http","code":"POST /auth/refresh\n","language":"http","meta":"","style":"undefined"},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"code","props":{"__ignoreMap":""},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"POST /auth/refresh\n"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The refresh token is read from the cookie automatically. A new access token is returned."}]},{"type":"element","tag":"h2","props":{"id":"logout"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Logout"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"pre","props":{"className":"language-http","code":"POST /auth/logout\n","language":"http","meta":"","style":"undefined"},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"code","props":{"__ignoreMap":""},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"POST /auth/logout\n"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Clears the refresh token cookie server-side."}]},{"type":"element","tag":"style","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":""}]}]},"toc":{"title":"","searchDepth":2,"depth":2,"links":[{"id":"login","depth":2,"text":"Login"},{"id":"token-refresh","depth":2,"text":"Token Refresh"},{"id":"logout","depth":2,"text":"Logout"}]}}},"mtime":1779736277903,"integrity":"sbEsKjG22l"}